{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17082","headline":"奉和武相公省中宿斋酬李相公见寄 · 郑絪","name":"奉和武相公省中宿斋酬李相公见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高阁安仁省，名园广武庐。\n沐兰朝太一，种竹咏华胥。\n禁静疎钟彻，庭开爽韵虚。\n洪钧齐万物，缥帙整羣书。\n寒露滋新菊，秋风落故蕖。\n同怀不同赏，幽意竟何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑絪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}